{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19945","headline":"石淙 九 · 孟郊","name":"石淙 九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔浮南渡飙，今攀朔山景。\n物色多瘦削，吟笑还孤永。\n日月冻有棱，雪霜空无影。\n玉喷不生冰，瑶涡旋成井。\n潜角时耸光，隐鳞乍漂冏。\n再吟获新胜，返步失前省。\n惬怀虽已多，惕虑未能整。\n颓阳落何处，昇魄衔疎岭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19945.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19945","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}